at eighty dollars fifty a barrel.

13
00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:42.160
That's its weakest since late August,
and Rigzone put the fall at four

14
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.360
point five percent by the close.

15
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.360
Brent was down three point six
percent at eighty-nine dollars twenty.

16
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.720
Dutch Title Transfer Facility gas, or TTF,

17
