19
00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.373
Starting in North Africa.

20
00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:03.560
An armed group closed a valve
on the pipeline from Sharara,

21
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.280
Libya's largest field, cutting
national output by about three hundred

22
00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.640
and fifty thousand barrels a day,
