23
00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:14.107
The corporation condemned the closure.

24
00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:17.333
It comes on top of a separate
shutdown of the Hamada pipeline,

25
00:01:17.387 --> 00:01:20.880
